0..74 Comment "// `exit.gandr`\'s handlers written by hand as the kernel replays them: the"
75..153 Comment "// handled body as a tree over `Proc`\'s one operation, the free model, and the"
154..227 Comment "// handler as a fold of the tree. A deep handler reinstalls itself in the"
228..306 Comment "// continuation, so the fold\'s clause resumes by folding what the continuation"
307..318 Comment "// answers."
